msgstr "Taiga「¿Esa cosa de aromaterapia o lo＿que sea? StuChi sí que se sube＿rápido a la última moda.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's definitely a \"cutting edge of＿fashion\" thing, but for her it's also＿work-related.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sin duda es algo de \"vanguardia de＿la moda\", pero para ella también tiene＿que ver con su trabajo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Stupid cutting-edge woman.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Estúpida mujer vanguardista.」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm sure those guys are stiff as all hell.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Seguro esos tipos están tensísimos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「...Oh...」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「...Ah...」"

msgid "Taiga「Forget it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Olvídalo.」"

msgid "Taiga「You're probably more interested than＿me.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Seguro te interesa más a ti que a mí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Me?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿A mí?」"

msgid "Taiga「Consider this: How many schmucks do＿you think would pay for a DVD of＿StuChi getting rubbed all over?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Piénsalo: ¿cuántos tontos crees que＿pagarían por un DVD de StuChi siendo＿masajeada por todos lados?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「...Oh...」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「...Ah...」"

msgid "Taiga「Wild MORON appeared.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Apareció un IDIOTA salvaje.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're the one who told me to think＿about it...... Sheesh.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tú fuiste la que me dijo que＿lo pensara...... Cielos.」"

msgid "Taiga「Surprising things?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Cosas sorprendentes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. Like, \"armor piercing questions\"＿and such......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. Como \"preguntas que atraviesan＿la armadura\" y cosas así......」"

msgid "Taiga「She's just stupidly proud of how good＿she is at guessing.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Solo está tontamente orgullosa＿de lo bien que adivina.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You think so? I feel like there's more＿to it......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Tú crees? Siento que hay＿algo más detrás......」"

msgid "Taiga「Excuse me? Surprising? Is she still＿leading you on with that fake＿personality?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Perdón? ¿Sorprendentes? ¿Todavía te＿engaña con esa personalidad falsa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「T-That's not what I meant. It's like, she＿finds the weak points in my resolve＿and jabs them......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No quise decir eso. Es como＿si ella me tocara los puntos débiles＿de mi voluntad......」"

msgid "Taiga「Grabs your WHAT!? I hope you drown＿in that pool!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Que te toca QUÉ?! ¡¡Ojalá te＿ahogues en esa piscina!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Forget it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Olvídalo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Good!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Bien!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Now it really sounds like you're＿training a dog.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ahora sí suena como si estuvieras＿entrenando a un perro.」"

msgid "Taiga「You should thank me!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Deberías darme las gracias!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Well, I guess I owe a large part of it＿to you. Yeah. Thanks.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Bueno, supongo que en gran parte＿te lo debo a ti. Sí. Gracias.」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't be shy! Just say it!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No seas tímido! ¡Solo dilo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Thank you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Gracias.」"

msgid "Taiga「Good!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Bien!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......It's like Freaky Friday or something.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Es como Freaky Friday o algo así.」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, that's nice.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, qué bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I'm a little confused by that reaction.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Esa reacción me confunde un poco.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You couldn't possibly care less,＿could you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No podría importarte＿menos, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......That's a very responsible thing to＿say.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Eso es algo＿muy responsable de decir.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, I'm always responsible.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oh, yo siempre soy responsable.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh really now.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ¿en serio?」"

msgid "Taiga「I don't want you going around picking＿random fights.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No quiero que andes buscando＿peleas sin motivo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're one to talk.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mira quién habla.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I wouldn't do that!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Y-Yo no haría eso!」"

msgid "Taiga「There's no time to waste＿eavesdropping gleefully on other＿people's arguments.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No hay tiempo que perder＿escuchando a escondidas＿con gusto las discusiones ajenas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I was NOT \"gleeful\" about it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「NO lo escuché \"con gusto\".」"

msgid "Taiga「I don't care.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No me importa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But Kitamura was involved! You should＿take this a little more seriously.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Pero Kitamura estaba implicado!＿Deberías tomártelo más en serio.」"

msgid "Taiga「Take it seriously, huh? Right back at＿you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tomarlo en serio, ¿eh? Lo mismo digo.」"

msgid "Taiga「As long as Kitamura-kun was able to＿resolve things, what does it matter?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Mientras Kitamura-kun haya podido＿resolver las cosas, ¿qué más da?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're taking it a little lightly.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Te lo estás tomando un poco a la ligera.」"

msgid "Taiga「In the end, it doesn't matter.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Al final, no importa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I guess.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Supongo.」"

msgid "Taiga「You really have no taste!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡De verdad no tienes gusto!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Wait. You look kinda heated.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E-Espera. Te ves algo alterada.」"

msgid "Taiga「I'll burn you to ashes!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Te reduciré a cenizas!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey...... Argh, I'm sorry for my pointless＿chatter.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye...... Agh, perdón por＿mi charla sin sentido.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Tch!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¡Tch!」"

